{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54330","headline":"吉州鲤 · 克符道者","name":"吉州鲤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五天慈雨细，师得润禅林。\n碧眼千灯印，清源一派心。\n有涯来敻远，无底更深沉。\n别嗣曹谿後。\n衆人仰德音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"克符道者","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54330.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54330","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}